<title>USA: Men's Wearhouse Q1 May 3 net increases.</title>
<headline>Men's Wearhouse Q1 May 3 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Interim Periods Ended</p>
<p>		     May 4, 1996 and May 3, 1997</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $130,621,000 $103,697,000</p>
<p> Net earnings				  4,016,000    3,109,000</p>
<p> Net earnings per share of common stock     0.19	   0.15</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common and common equivalent shares outstanding</p>
<p>						  21,248,000   21,212,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Full name of company is Men's Wearhouse Inc.</p>
</text>
